<title>CANADA: RESEARCH ALERT - Canadian banks upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Canadian banks upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it raised ratings on several Canadian banks.</p>
<p>-- Goldman said it raised National Bank of Canada, Toronto-Dominion Bank and Bank of Nova Scotia to market outperformer from market performer.</p>
<p>-- Goldman said it raised Royal Bank of Canada and Canadian Imperial Bank of Commerce to recommended list from market outperformer.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
